Last year, I made a javascript program to calculate this. This looks like a
good place to share it.

It's based on a spoiler I read:
http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/343/spl1-343.html

I have observed occasional slight (< 3%) discrepancies between its results
and nethack's displayed chance-to-fail values. Whether they're due to a bug
in my code or in what I read, I don't know.

I release this to the public, etc, etc. Feel free to modify it, improve it,
redistribute it, whatever. Maybe it'll find a home at the List of Nethack
Spoilers.

Sorry there's so much text. I don't know how/if to post attachments, and I
don't have my own website. Hopefully it will not violate any rules, cause
weird things to happen, or be too much of an eyesore.

Copy and paste everything between&including the <html></html> tags into a
text file, save it, and rename it to ChanceToCast.HTML

-Brian


